---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} headerVariant="dark" headerOverlay>
<div class="hm rv-page">
  <ProductHero
    wide
    h1={"See exactly where your\nrevenue is leaking."}
    lead="Birdie reveals which bays, days, and hours are costing you money — and gives you the tools to fix it. Built with real simulator operators."
    primary={{ label: 'Book a demo', href: SITE.demoPath }}
    secondary={{ label: 'See how it works', href: '#revenue-system' }}
    ticker={heroTicker}
  />

  <section class="hm-sec hm-white hm-stack rv-gap">
    <div class="rv-gap__card">
      <div class="rv-gap__vis">
        <div class="rv-gap__heat">
          <div class="rv-gap__h"><b>Weekday revenue gap</b><span>This week</span></div>
          <div class="rv-gap__stats">
            <div>Potential<b>$7,392</b></div><div>Actual<b>$4,132</b></div><div class="left">Left on Table<b>$3,260</b></div>
          </div>
          <div class="rv-gap__grid" role="img" aria-label="Weekday heat map of booked and empty hours, Monday to Friday">
            <span></span>{hours.map((h) => <span class="h">{h}</span>)}
            {days.map((d, di) => (<><span>{d}</span>{hours.map((_, hi) => <i class={heat[di][hi] ? 'on' : ''}></i>)}</>))}
          </div>
          <div class="rv-gap__legend"><span class="bk">Booked</span><span class="em">Empty</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rv-gap__txt">
        <h2>Tuesday at 2pm<i>.</i> Three empty bays. You've seen this before<i>.</i></h2>
        <p>Your weekends book themselves. But those 3–4 hour gaps between weekday bookings? That's where thousands quietly disappear every month. Revenue you don't get back. You don't need more traffic first — you need visibility first.</p>
        <ul class="rv-gap__list">
          {problemBullets.map((t, n) => <li><span class="ic" set:html={GAP_ICONS[n]} />{t}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Revenue calculator (section 3) — Figma "Features / Option 2": light inputs card with +/- steppers, dark "Revenue summary" result card on the compat-bg glow -->
  <section class="hm-sec hm-white hm-stack rv-calc" id="calculator">
    <div class="hm-intro">
      <h2 class="hm-h2">How much are empty weekdays actually costing you?</h2>
      <p class="hm-sub" style="max-width:800px">Plug in your numbers. Most operators don't realize the size of the gap until they see it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cc-card rv-calc__card">
      <div class="cc-in">
        <h2>Your venue</h2>
        <div class="cc-rowlist">
          <Stepper id="bays" label="Bays" value={4} min={1} />
          <Stepper id="rate" label="Hourly rate ($)" value={4} min={1} prefix="$" />
          <Stepper id="hours" label="Open hours/day" value={8} min={1} />
          <Stepper id="util" label="Utilization (%)" value={20} min={1} max={100} suffix="%" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cc-out" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="cc-out__bg" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="/assets/home/compat-bg.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="cc-out__c">
          <h2>Revenue quietly disappearing every month</h2>
          <div class="cc-out__body">
            <p class="cc-big"><strong id="out" style="font-weight:inherit">$0</strong><span class="rv-calc__per"> / mo</span></p>
            <div class="cc-rows">
              <div><span>Per week</span><strong id="outWk">$0</strong></div>
              <div><span>Per year</span><strong id="outYr">$0</strong></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a class="bd-btn bd-btn--light cc-out__cta" href={SITE.demoPath}>Book a demo</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Revenue system (section 4) — reuses the homepage "Live in 24 hours" hm-setup progress timeline verbatim (line + travelling ball + numbered marks); only icons/content differ -->
  <section class="hm-sec hm-white hm-stack rv-tl" id="revenue-system">
    <div class="hm-intro">
      <h2 class="hm-h2">This isn't just booking software<i>.</i><br class="hm-brm" />It's a revenue system<i>.</i></h2>
      <p class="hm-sub" style="max-width:820px" set:html={'Most tools stop at the reservation. Birdie turns every booking into data, visibility, and the next repeat visit. Every cycle closes more gaps. It\'s the revenue layer inside Birdie\'s <a class="bd-link" href="/golf-simulator-management-software/" style="text-decoration:underline">golf simulator management software</a> — one platform for bookings, memberships, and the numbers behind them.'} />
    </div>
    <div class="hm-setup" data-setup-progress>
      <div class="hm-setup__line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="hm-setup__trail" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <img class="hm-setup__ball" src="/assets/home/setup-ball.webp" alt="" width="40" height="40" />
      {steps.map(([t, d, note], i) => (
        <div class={`hm-setup__row${i % 2 === 0 ? ' tl' : ' tr'}${i === 0 ? ' feat' : ''}`}>
